{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794535872864,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b73fffeVFUa7eufkRporf","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2ac56ee0020O2mPomih3FPIz","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b73fffeVFUa7eufkRporf","messageID":"msg_1d2ac4e7e001tK6xvwQ3aqLKSi","type":"tool","id":"call_ab0c637302654e3bb357dda6","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg -n -A 14 \"command: /doctor:skill-advisor\" .skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml | head -60","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"108:  - command: /doctor:skill-advisor\n109-    target: tune\n110-    yaml: doctor-skill-advisor-tune.yaml\n111-    setup_vars: [execution_mode, scope, skip_tests, dry_run]\n112-    allowed_flags: [\"--skip-tests\", \"--dry-run\", \"--scope=all|explicit|derived|lexical\"]\n113-    mutating: mutates\n114-    gate3_location: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts + .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/lexical.ts + .skilled/skills/*/graph-metadata.json\"\n115-    cli_commands:\n116-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --prompt \"<prompt>\" --format json --warm-only'\n117-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root \"$PWD\" --format json --warm-only'\n118-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_validate --confirm-heavy-run true --format json'\n119-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_rebuild --trusted --force true --format json'\n120-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json'\n121-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_validate --format json --warm-only'\n122-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_query --queryType <depends_on|dependents|enhances|enhanced_by|family_members|conflicts|transitive_path|hub_skills|orphans|subgraph> --format json'\n--\n132:  - command: /doctor:skill-advisor\n133-    target: rebuild\n134-    yaml: doctor-skill-advisor-rebuild.yaml\n135-    setup_vars: [execution_mode, dry_run]\n136-    allowed_flags: [\"--dry-run\"]\n137-    mutating: mutates\n138-    gate3_location: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database/skill-graph.sqlite (backed up beside itself before the rebuild)\"\n139-    cli_commands:\n140-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root \"$PWD\" --format json --warm-only'\n141-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_rebuild --trusted --force true --format json'\n142-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json'\n143-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_validate --format json --warm-only'\n144-    mcp_tools: []   # CLI front door only, no MCP calls\n145-    trigger_phrases:\n146-      - \"skill advisor rebuild\"\n--\n152:  - command: /doctor:skill-advisor\n153-    target: skill-budget\n154-    yaml: doctor-skill-budget.yaml\n155-    setup_vars: [execution_mode, json_output, top_n, fail_over, project_ceiling]\n156-    allowed_flags: [\"--json\", \"--top-n=N\", \"--fail-over=N\", \"--project-ceiling=N\"]\n157-    mutating: read-only\n158-    gate3_location: \"n/a (read-only audit; no spec folder required)\"\n159-    mcp_tools: []   # script-only audit; no MCP calls\n160-    script_invocations:\n161-      - 'python3 .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/audit_descriptions.py --repo-root \"$PWD\"  # description-budget audit. The workflow adds --json, --top-n, --fail-over, and --project-ceiling from the resolved flags'\n162-      - 'Warm-only: probe the existing system-skill-advisor IPC socket first; only when it answers, run node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root \"$PWD\" --format json --timeout-ms 500 --warm-only (the flag guarantees no daemon start; exit 75 = backend unavailable, retryable)'\n163-    trigger_phrases:\n164-      - \"skill budget audit\"\n165-      - \"description budget check\"\n166-      - \"skill char count drift\"\n--\n171:  - command: /doctor:skill-advisor\n172-    target: parent-skill\n173-    yaml: doctor-parent-skill.yaml\n174-    setup_vars: [execution_mode, parent_skill_dir]\n175-    allowed_flags: [\"--dir=<path>\"]\n176-    mutating: read-only\n177-    gate3_location: \"n/a (read-only structural audit; inspects a parent skill's graph-metadata/registry and reports, no writes)\"\n178-    mcp_tools: []   # script-only structural audit; no MCP calls\n179-    script_invocations:\n180-      # The fleet class gate runs first: it starts from SKILL.md, so it is the only\n181-      # check that can report a metadata file a root never wrote. The per-hub audit\n182-      # then goes deep on the one directory the operator named.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"108:  - command: /doctor:skill-advisor\n109-    target: tune\n110-    yaml: doctor-skill-advisor-tune.yaml\n111-    setup_vars: [execution_mode, scope, skip_tests, dry_run]\n112-    allowed_flags: [\"--skip-tests\", \"--dry-run\", \"--scope=all|explicit|derived|lexical\"]\n113-    mutating: mutates\n114-    gate3_location: \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/explicit.ts + .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/lanes/lexical.ts + .skilled/skills/*/graph-metadata.json\"\n115-    cli_commands:\n116-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_recommend --prompt \"<prompt>\" --format json --warm-only'\n117-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_status --workspace-root \"$PWD\" --format json --warm-only'\n118-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_validate --confirm-heavy-run true --format json'\n119-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs advisor_rebuild --trusted --force true --format json'\n120-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json'\n121-      - 'node .skilled/bin/skill-adv