{"type":"text","timestamp":1794535946567,"sessionID":"ses_e2d54b73fffeVFUa7eufkRporf","part":{"id":"prt_1d2ad671f001FLoqxgs25hR6G0","sessionID":"ses_e2d54b73fffeVFUa7eufkRporf","messageID":"msg_1d2ad5845001r9e9ckEHGE3zpA","type":"text","text":"Done.\n\n## Files written\n\n`/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`\n\nTwo changes, both in that file:\n\n- `CHECKLIST_STEPS` now holds six entries, with `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` (owner `/doctor:skill-advisor`, target `embedder`, `mutating: mutates`, read from the manifest) inserted as the fifth and `/doctor:setup` moved to the sixth.\n- The checklist contract test now iterates by index and asserts that both `doctor-install-presentation.txt` and `doctor-install.yaml` carry each step under its own number (`1)` through `6)`), so the embedder is required as step 5 and setup as step 6.\n\n## Verify output\n\nCommand: `node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`\n\n```\n✔ the manifest holds one read-only install route matching the frozen contract (0.859417ms)\n✔ the install route phrases and declared commands agree with the workflow contract (0.24125ms)\n✔ the printed checklist names each route owner with its mutation class and reason (0.22025ms)\n✔ the router follows the router template: six canonical sections in order and no inline presentation (0.131708ms)\n✔ the router frontmatter stays within budget and grants only the tools it uses (0.176375ms)\n✔ the router binds its guide target to the workflow asset named by the route (0.043292ms)\n✔ the router keeps shortcuts and flag handling within the frozen interface (0.062333ms)\n✔ the presentation carries install errors, the build checks, prompt, inspection and ordered steps (0.205416ms)\n✔ the presentation prints writing commands for the operator and closes on the family convention (0.086625ms)\n✔ the workflow is read-only, grants no write target and runs the route scripts (0.097917ms)\n✔ the workflow declares every variable its route resolves (0.052875ms)\n✔ the workflow asks once, inspects once and hands all writing steps back (0.056ms)\n✔ the doctor contract carries every field its schema requires and nothing it forbids (0.064833ms)\n✔ the contract names the install router, workflow, presentation and hint (0.059ms)\n✔ the contract publishes the install invocation alias (0.038708ms)\n✔ the contract describes the install loader behavior (0.040542ms)\nℹ tests 16\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 16\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 6.195083\nEXIT=0\n```\n\n## Scope\n\n`git diff --stat` on the named file shows `11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)`; no other file was touched, no checkbox ticked, no git state changed.\n\nNothing was left undone.","time":{"start":1794535941919,"end":1794535946567}}}
